{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/ee09b5cd45854a18d030fd9602d46e2e.avif?t=1771252459\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout, choose your art brushes, and blast your way to a masterpiece! <strong>Pew-casso</strong> is a top-down action-roguelite shooter where you defeat rounds of enemies to create a piece of art. The longer you last, the more complex your unique piece of art will become. Level up to unlock new abilities and art brushes. Customize your loadout to match your play style. Utilize a wide range of artistic options to make each piece truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>40 levels</strong> of unlockables to modify and customize your combat loadout and artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/e96569a78926461b1c5701265095cc3a.avif?t=1771252459\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Onslaught:</strong> A combat-only mode with increased enemy numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objectives:</strong> Battle enemies while completing a variety of objectives.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel Dispatch:</strong> Deliver fuel to two transports to help them reach their docks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the point:</strong> A moving king of the hill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Megaton:</strong> Power up a bomb to activate a devastating blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juggernaut:</strong> Charge up cannons to take down the juggernaut and its weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overload:</strong> Overload the machine, filling the arena with path-blocking boxes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/00401f0f60c133ccbf3dcede8d890b4e.poster.avif?t=1771252459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/00401f0f60c133ccbf3dcede8d890b4e.webm?t=1771252459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/00401f0f60c133ccbf3dcede8d890b4e.mp4?t=1771252459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More to follow, including boss fights...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/0e3cdb1ba8ca9275787d31aeb8e43f13.avif?t=1771252459\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique enemy types with different strengths and weaknesses to adjust to on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth combat and bullet time system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable loadout: Choose from 2 active and 1 passive ability to customize your play style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/817ca6b890ef5734d7208e8cdb05726f.poster.avif?t=1771252459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/817ca6b890ef5734d7208e8cdb05726f.webm?t=1771252459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/817ca6b890ef5734d7208e8cdb05726f.mp4?t=1771252459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A current total of 15 abilities to unlock, with more to come.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/44dc900e737708089f28e95da5782d4f.avif?t=1771252459\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable paint brushes: Choose between 3 levels of art brushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of backgrounds, borders, and overlays to apply the finishing touches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A current total of 21 brushes to unlock, with more to come.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/21295ac20be1b81c5d5b27b181b717ec.poster.avif?t=1771252459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/21295ac20be1b81c5d5b27b181b717ec.webm?t=1771252459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/21295ac20be1b81c5d5b27b181b717ec.mp4?t=1771252459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Customizable color palettes in development)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/dcd771367263772d55d260ef3131544f.avif?t=1771252459\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different playlists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring tracks and original music from Light Diver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off the music to play your own tunes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community and help shape the future of Pew-casso!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008800/extras/99eaa214c22c0b49a7fb33bc034e8339.avif?t=1771252459\" width=1200 height=2000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Basquiat Is Born","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/17d0d9e38f6f687b0aacb3b16e772d09bcdc1909.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Rembrandt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/8d6f6a2346bf23740c9b53f2c9ec5674a31dc34b.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Picasso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/7fd132c6f273f6e5cea03afba726c45ba2233f1e.jpg"},{"name":"Vincent Van Gun ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/2af8673a4e2e5305bd087da63aaef5ea93bf314d.jpg"},{"name":" Salvo-dor Dal\u00ed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/989e5adaf55111737c4b9a22a8e10e8f8091d297.jpg"},{"name":"War-hol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/2bcc549d97aa29d65aeb47cba8dfb7d885fd3d73.jpg"},{"name":"Frank Lloyd Wrecking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/60909c60846db324f576513f8a269670a0385276.jpg"},{"name":"Blast Wave Banksy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4008800/e703702b86cbd7b6bbd1083436030991e01ad00d.jpg"},{"name":"Gatling Goya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati